<title>UK: London tea sale average price.</title>
<headline>London tea sale average price.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average for the 4,065 packages of landed tea sold at this weeks London sale was 140.56 pence a kilo against 143.35 last week and 117.44 a year ago.</p>
<p>The average for the 84,627 pkgs sold so far this year is 129.03 pence against 114.03 pence for the 107,010 pkgs sold by this stage last year.</p>
